{{Term/Store|Raw Meat|Raw Meats|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Material"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Quests|
{{BotW Quest
 |name= Koko Cuisine
 |type= Side Quest
 |giver= [[Koko]]
 |location= [[Kakariko Village]]
}}
}}
Raw Meat is dropped by [[Woodland Boar]]s, [[Mountain Goat]]s, and [[Grassland Fox]]es when they are killed. It is also sold by two separate [[Wandering Merchant]]s, those being [[Cambo]] and [[Mezer]]. Raw Meat can be eaten to heal one [[Heart]]. It can be cooked by a [[Fire]] to make [[Seared Steak]] or frozen with [[Ice]] to create [[Icy Meat]].

As part of the [[Side Quest]] "[[Koko Cuisine]]", [[Link]] must gather Raw Meat for [[Koko]] so she can make [[Tough Meat-Stuffed Pumpkin]].<ref name="BotW Koko"/> When Link brings her Raw Meat, Koko will be excited and reward Link with Meat-Stuffed Pumpkin.<ref name="BotW Koko 2"/>

