Raw Meats return in {{TotK}}. They are dropped by the same [[Animal]]s when killed, with the addition of [[Forest Ostrich]]es. Raw Meats restore one [[Heart]] to [[Link]]'s [[Life Gauge]] when eaten. Raw Meat can also be burned or frozen to make [[Seared Steak]], and [[Icy Meat]], respectively.

Raw Meat can also be [[Fuse]]d to [[Equipment]] and [[Mineru's Construct]], increasing the [[Weapon]] or [[Arrow]]'s attack power by one. When Fused to Mineru's Construct, Raw Meat has a Fuse durability of five. Raw Meats can still be burned or frozen when Fused, and they do not conduct [[Electricity]]. Additionally, when Fused to a Weapon or [[Shield]], the Raw Meat removes its sharpness or its ability to be used for [[Shield Surfing]], respectively.

